<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's TGS data flawed on Argentine bolsa.</title>
<headline>Argentina's TGS data flawed on Argentine bolsa.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Transportadora de Gas del Sur, or TGS, was quoted ex-dividend Wednesday in Buenos Aires and New York, but its local price change did not reflect this due to an error made by the local stock exchange, company sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was quoted at $2.61 on the bolsa, whose data system showed a price drop of 3.0 percent rather than the 0.8 percent gain it really has ex-dividend.</p>
<p>The company is set to pay a $0.10 per share dividend on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0657))</p>
